  "factor_name": "Volatility-scaled trend persistence with positive-trend gate",
  "version": "1.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "((close/close.shift(20)-1) - (close/close.shift(60)-1)/3) / (std(pct_change(close),20)*sqrt(252)); if ret60 <= 0 multiply by 0.25",
    "description": "Ranks assets by recent 20-day trend relative to a one-third 60-day baseline, scaled by 20-day annualized volatility. Persistent positive 60-day trends retain full signal; non-positive medium trends are strongly downweighted. Inputs are lagged at each decision date. Higher values predict higher subsequent returns."
  },
